    Bug 288120 - Modernize NewsDownloader for offline use of newsgroups. r=mkmelin


    - Extend the functionality of `NewsDownloader`, use it via `NewsService` in the `nsMsgNewsFolder` methods, and remove nsNewsDownloader.* altogether.
    - Do not download articles from ignored threads/subthreads for offline use.
    - Respect the maximum message size for offline use.
    - Update the folder size in the GUI after offline operations.
    - Include server name in status bar message.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D246035

